{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prop Sumo is a party fighting game that pits ordinary props together in extraordinary battles!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beat up your friends and dominate the scoreboard!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >OUTPLAY YOUR FRIENDS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal in Prop Sumo is to be the <strong>highest scoring prop.</strong> Brawl your opponents with a variety of melee moves, or just launch yourself into them with a powerful charge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash a chain of light and heavy attacks to send your friends flying in every direction!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089420/extras/a60fc2c24f8c60e6c0cbe442d0aefbb1.poster.avif?t=1772143330\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089420/extras/a60fc2c24f8c60e6c0cbe442d0aefbb1.webm?t=1772143330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089420/extras/a60fc2c24f8c60e6c0cbe442d0aefbb1.mp4?t=1772143330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UNLEASH POWERFUL ITEMS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn the tide of the match with <strong>22 unique items</strong>, from magnetising mines to firey explosions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use items to make game-changing plays that can flip the chaos into victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089420/extras/317d38cda4065e3c5b972763c7b5f717.poster.avif?t=1772143330\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089420/extras/317d38cda4065e3c5b972763c7b5f717.webm?t=1772143330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089420/extras/317d38cda4065e3c5b972763c7b5f717.mp4?t=1772143330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EPIC ARENAS, EPIC FIGHTS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle it out on <strong>stunning, dynamic maps</strong> built for mayhem!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From surging rivers to tangled vines and molten lava, only you can decide if they're threats or knockout opportunities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089420/extras/eae861e84415f26d11a1a76d2b4cdfeb.poster.avif?t=1772143330\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089420/extras/eae861e84415f26d11a1a76d2b4cdfeb.webm?t=1772143330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089420/extras/eae861e84415f26d11a1a76d2b4cdfeb.mp4?t=1772143330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EARN IT ALL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain experience from every fight to <strong>unlock coupons!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Redeem them to unlock new powerful ultimates, unique props, and stylish cosmetics!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089420/extras/c5e3ffb52270c12a49e03f353b0d2523.poster.avif?t=1772143330\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089420/extras/c5e3ffb52270c12a49e03f353b0d2523.webm?t=1772143330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089420/extras/c5e3ffb52270c12a49e03f353b0d2523.mp4?t=1772143330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STYLE YOUR WAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customise your prop with a <strong>huge selection of cosmetic items!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tweak the position, scale and rotation of each accessory to design your unique look!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089420/extras/403e7e1598e6fb186d6eb48bb60565d2.poster.avif?t=1772143330\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089420/extras/403e7e1598e6fb186d6eb48bb60565d2.webm?t=1772143330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089420/extras/403e7e1598e6fb186d6eb48bb60565d2.mp4?t=1772143330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SET THE RULES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Control the chaos</strong> your way - add lives, disable hazards, remove round timers, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you want an intense 1v1 or a laid-back free-for-all, you're in control!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>16 playable props</strong>, each with their own benefits to suit your playstyle!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>22 powerful items</strong>, giving you an advantage over your friends!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>9 dynamic maps</strong>, perfect for groups from 2 to 6 players!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep customisation system</strong> to style your prop your way!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progression and unlocks</strong>\u00a0to be earned at the end of each round!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Training Dojo</strong> to master moves and combos!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Host settings and private lobbies</strong> for full control over your matches!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prop Sumo is <strong>peer-to-peer only</strong> and best enjoyed with friends. However, we have a <strong>server browser</strong> so you can jump into matches against strangers too!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>We're developing Prop Sumo with player feedback at the core, so please send us your feedback over on the Steam Forums and Prop Sumo Discord server!</i> </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3089420?t=1772143330","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3089420?t=1772143330","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089420/84c7ff180c60e8f335c3f41dd4aefe1cbd394812/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772143330","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089420/84c7ff180c60e8f335c3f41dd4aefe1cbd394812/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772143330","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prop Sumo is a party fighting game that pits ordinary props together in extraordinary battles!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beat up your friends and dominate the scoreboard!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >OUTPLAY YOUR FRIENDS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal in Prop Sumo is to be the <strong>highest scoring prop.</strong> Brawl your opponents with a variety of melee moves, or just launch yourself into them with a powerful charge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash a chain of light and heavy attacks to send your friends flying in every direction!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089420/extras/a60fc2c24f8c60e6c0cbe442d0aefbb1.poster.avif?t=1772143330\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089420/extras/a60fc2c24f8c60e6c0cbe442d0aefbb1.webm?t=1772143330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089420/extras/a60fc2c24f8c60e6c0cbe442d0aefbb1.mp4?t=1772143330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UNLEASH POWERFUL ITEMS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn the tide of the match with <strong>22 unique items</strong>, from magnetising mines to firey explosions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use items to make game-changing plays that can flip the chaos into victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089420/extras/317d38cda4065e3c5b972763c7b5f717.poster.avif?t=1772143330\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089420/extras/317d38cda4065e3c5b972763c7b5f717.webm?t=1772143330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089420/extras/317d38cda4065e3c5b972763c7b5f717.mp4?t=1772143330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EPIC ARENAS, EPIC FIGHTS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle it out on <strong>stunning, dynamic maps</strong> built for mayhem!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From surging rivers to tangled vines and molten lava, only you can decide if they're threats or knockout opportunities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089420/extras/eae861e84415f26d11a1a76d2b4cdfeb.poster.avif?t=1772143330\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089420/extras/eae861e84415f26d11a1a76d2b4cdfeb.webm?t=1772143330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089420/extras/eae861e84415f26d11a1a76d2b4cdfeb.mp4?t=1772143330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EARN IT ALL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain experience from every fight to <strong>unlock coupons!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Redeem them to unlock new powerful ultimates, unique props, and stylish cosmetics!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089420/extras/c5e3ffb52270c12a49e03f353b0d2523.poster.avif?t=1772143330\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089420/extras/c5e3ffb52270c12a49e03f353b0d2523.webm?t=1772143330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089420/extras/c5e3ffb52270c12a49e03f353b0d2523.mp4?t=1772143330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STYLE YOUR WAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customise your prop with a <strong>huge selection of cosmetic items!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tweak the position, scale and rotation of each accessory to design your unique look!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089420/extras/403e7e1598e6fb186d6eb48bb60565d2.poster.avif?t=1772143330\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089420/extras/403e7e1598e6fb186d6eb48bb60565d2.webm?t=1772143330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089420/extras/403e7e1598e6fb186d6eb48bb60565d2.mp4?t=1772143330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SET THE RULES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Control the chaos</strong> your way - add lives, disable hazards, remove round timers, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you want an intense 1v1 or a laid-back free-for-all, you're in control!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>16 playable props</strong>, each with their own benefits to suit your playstyle!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>22 powerful items</strong>, giving you an advantage over your friends!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>9 dynamic maps</strong>, perfect for groups from 2 to 6 players!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep customisation system</strong> to style your prop your way!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progression and unlocks</strong>\u00a0to be earned at the end of each round!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Training Dojo</strong> to master moves and combos!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Host settings and private lobbies</strong> for full control over your matches!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prop Sumo is <strong>peer-to-peer only</strong> and best enjoyed with friends. However, we have a <strong>server browser</strong> so you can jump into matches against strangers too!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>We're developing Prop Sumo with player feedback at the core, so please send us your feedback over on the Steam Forums and Prop Sumo Discord server!</i> </p>","developers":["Barrel Roll Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089420/61bb501ec41d3bdd52f15558970f7cd80d48dbd7/header.jpg?t=1772143330","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3089420/12034522/d7d343a0d145534fb941e86bca35fa9592da86b4/1752483253/dash_av1.mpd?t=1752511988","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3089420/12034522/d7d343a0d145534fb941e86bca35fa9592da86b4/1752483253/dash_h264.mpd?t=1752511988","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3089420/12034522/d7d343a0d145534fb941e86bca35fa9592da86b4/1752483253/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1752511988","id":257168561,"name":"Prop Sumo Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257168561/6ec90310246b46ec79baf0012f57d37aded6a856/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1752511988"}],"name":"Prop Sumo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 64Bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel I3 / Ryzen 3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</stron